\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Orationes votivae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Precationes pro virtutibus et aliis dei donis, ut iis a deo exornemur. Pro timore et amore dei precatio ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 CO}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr 5346. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. CO Nr 1532. (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pro fide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnipotens eterne deus, qui es Alpha et Omega, principium et finis creaturarum omnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro fide, spe et charitate oratio ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. CO Nr 3819. (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro fervore spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b. CO Nr 1261. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro bonis cogitationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b. CO Nr 1494. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b. CO Nr 1085. (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. CO Nr 3953 (2. Formular). (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tempore seditionis et tumultus bellici precatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnipotens eterne ac misericors deus, etsi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per iniquitates nostras multiplices vitam impuram et gravia delicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Die \u252 \'fcbrigen nicht liturgischen Initien im Register.}

