\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Statuta ordinis Praemonstratensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Anno 1290. (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quoniam ex precepto regule iubem[ur ha]be[re cor u]num et animam unam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequuntur capitula prime distinctionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Dist. I.: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cap. primum. De sacramento altaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In sacramento altaris tria sunt necessaria}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 [Dist. IV, cap. 23] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nam huiusmodi destructiones nostri ordinis reputamus. Expliciunt statuta Premonstratensis ordinis que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a reverendo patre domino Guilberto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (recte: Guilelmo [de Louvignies]) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 abbate Premonstratensi de consilio coabbatum suorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sunt renovata nec non in aliquibus inmutata ac eciam recisa in locis illis, in quibus videbatur quod non possent comode\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 servari. Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cc nonagesimo in capitulo generali. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Anno 1322. (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequuntur capitula quinte distinctionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85; Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam post ultimam compilacionem statutorum ordinis, que sub quatuor distinctionibus continentur, multa statuta extravagantia penas graves continentia emanarunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cap. 1. De fratribus emittendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum plures prelati ordinis penas in statutis contentas minus timeant quam deberent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 [cap. 17] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et secundum formam ordinis provideri.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Acta sunt hec et approbata anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ccc xxii sedente capitulo generali et in hoc terminatur quinta distinctio. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck der Distinctiones I\endash IV: Ioannes Le Paige, Bibliotheca Pr\u230 \'e6monstratensis Ordinis [\u8230 \'85], Paris 1633 (Ndr. [Instrumenta Praemonstratensia III/1\endash 2], Averbode 1998), Pars posterior, S. 784\endash 831; Druck der Distinctio V: ebd., S. 832\endash 839. Vgl. Acta et Decreta Capitulorum Generalium Ordinis Praemonstratensis. [Bd 1: 1174\endash 1500]. Ed. J.B. Valvekens, Averbode 1966, S. 74.}

