\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De excommunicatione maiori et minori. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quoniam confessor debet prius interrogari penitentem de excommunicatione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et primo nota bene, quod due sunt species excommunicationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scilicet maioris et minoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad martirium prepararet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Aus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antoninus Florentinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Confessionale \u8218 \'82Defecerunt\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Recensio longior. Druck: GW 2105, 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (verglichen: VB 3354.20), die Angaben zur Excommunicatio maior in der Hs ausf\u252 \'fchrlicher.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De excommunicatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota diligenter, quod secundum iura communia excommunicati etiam non denuntiati deberent evitari}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cuius constitutionis tenor sequitur et est talis:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8222 \'84Insuper ad vitanda scandala\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 volumus abstineri iuxta canonicas sanctiones.\ldblquote  In consilio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Constantiensi sub Martino quinto hoc decretum fuit, approbatum utrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (recte: iterum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in conscilio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Basiliensi et per E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 genium tunc papam, ut asseruit mihi dominus Julianus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Giuliano Cesarini], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui ibi legatus fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Aus: [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Antoninus Florentinus\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de censuris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], cap. 86\endash 87 nach Z\u228 \'e4hlung des Drucks: GW 2068 (verglichen: VB 3018). Vgl. f\u252 \'fcr die Bulle Papst Martins V. von 1418: Mansi 27, Sp. 1192f.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Notae de excommunicatione minori et de absolutione ab excommunicatione maiori. Kurze, teils zusammenfassende Exzerpte aus: [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Antoninus Florentinus: Tractatus de censuris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], cap. 82. 84. 83 nach Z\u228 \'e4hlung des Drucks: GW 2068 (verglichen: VB 3018). S.a. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, Scriptores OP}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr 253. CALMA 1.3, S. 300 Nr 16.}

