\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachtrag: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super arboribus consanguinitatis et affinitatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circa arboris lecturam diversis diversum modum tenentibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 collaterales contrahere non video. Johannes Andreae. Ad arborem affinitatis et eius materiam transeamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 continuo perseverent per graciam eius qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. Johannes Andreae. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Darunter von einem italienischen Schreiber Transkriptionsversuch der vorletzten Zeile. Druck: GW 1676\endash 1680 u.\u246 \'f6. Ed.: Friedberg 1, Sp. 1427\endash 1430 u. 1433\endash 1436. Schulte, Geschichte 2, S. 215f. \endash  164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

