\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Psalterium feriatum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Cursus Romanus. Psalmen und Cantica in der liturgischen Reihenfolge. Textl\u252 \'fccke durch Blattverlust: Ps 80,8\endash 82,16. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit ordo psalterij secundum consuetudinem Romane curie. Invitatoria subscripta dicuntur singulis diebus dominicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Invitatorium primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Venite exultemus domino}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Laus sancti Ambrosij et Augustini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Te deum. \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus X/1, S. 92. (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit plalterium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b.
