\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge: (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hymnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In feria vi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad vesperas hymnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  51, Nr 39. Es folgen Versikel und Magnificat-Antiphon.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Birger Gregersson}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Officium sanctae Birgittae Suecicae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit officium in sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [m]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pnitate ipsius sancte Brigide secundum ordinem Romanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 curie. In primi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vesperis super psalmum antiphona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Brigide matris inclite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Ed.: Undhagen, Officium, S. 177\endash 230. 236f.; Vesper-Antiphonen umgestellt: Nr I/IV/III/V/II. Mit den Hymnen:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  AH}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4, Nr 207. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  43, Nr 167. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  52, Nr 154. Als Lektionen der drei Nokturnen: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonifatius IX. papa}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bulla canonizationis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Exzerpt. (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit legenda sancte Brigide de regio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Suecie scilicet canonizacionis; innumerabil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a enim sunt que dominus per eam dignato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est demonstrare ut continentur plenius in libro miraculorum et vite ipsius. Lectio prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beata siquidem Brigida mulier gratiosa ex patre Birgero et matre Sigrida\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Druck: ActaSS Okt. IV (1866), S. 469f. Nr 418\endash 422; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr 1359.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Litania omnium sanctorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], f\u252 \'fcr Servitenorden (?). Bemerkenswert: \u8230 \'85 [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ancta Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dei mater et virgo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, [g]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lorioxa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 regina celorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; zweimalige Anrufung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sancte pater Augustine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; bei den Jungfrauen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maria Magdalena, Iustina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Patronin von Padua) \u8230 \'85; F\u252 \'fcrbitten: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut civitate nostram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut omnibus fidelibus navigantibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Mit Versikelreihe \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salvos fac servos et ancilas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tuas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Requiescant in pacem. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f0\fs24 \u186 \'ba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Bricht ab.}

