\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Wahlspr\u252 \'fcche}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )]: 1. [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistula 6}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Exzerpt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Non timebo hominum iudicium habiturus iudicem meum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ed.: CSEL 54, S. 25 Z. 11\endash 12. \endash  2. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Precipuum senectutis solatium est bene vixisse in iuventute.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Optimum senectuti viaticum erudi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tio]. \endash  In der Blattmitte: Zeichnung, s.o. \endash  Besitzstempel, s.o.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Besitzvermerk, s.o. \endash  [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dicta]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Heu vivunt homines tamquam mors nulla sequatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  / Et velut infernus fabula vana foret.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Aus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  11284; vgl. PL 152, Sp. 38. \endash  2. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo 39}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Exzerpt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Latet ultimus dies, ut observentur omnes dies}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ed.: CC 41, S. 489 Z. 13\endash 14. \endash  3. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo 48}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Exzerpt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Veniet dies illa, in qua nulli malo erit bene et nulli bono erit male}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ed.: CC 41, S. 609 Z. 121\endash 122. Vgl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus X/1, S. 441 Nr 75. \endash  4. [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-] Bernardus [Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Formula honestae vitae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Exzerpt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa philosophia est meditatio mortis assidua}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. PL 184, Sp. 1170, 3. Z. v.u.}

