\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Wappen des Abtes Johannes Schweickhofer, s.o. \endash  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dicta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. 1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Missa est legittima (!) consecratio et oblatio corporis et sanguinis domini nostri Ihesu Christi in altari}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  2. auf dem Papierzettel neben dem Wappen: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas a Kempis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De imitatione Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], lib. 4, cap. 5, n. 19. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quando sacerdos celebrat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 participem efficit. Hec Iohannes Gerson.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ed.: De imitatione Christi libri quatuor. Hrsg. Von Tiburzio Lupo (Storia et attualit\u224 \'e0 6), Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 1982, S. 325. \endash  3. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo 46}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Exzerpt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnis, qui male vivit in conspectu eorum quibus prepositus est, quantum in ipso est, omnes occidit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ed.: CC 41, S. 536 Z. 204\endash 205. Vgl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus X/1, S. 441 Nr 75.}

