\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Von anderer Hand: 1. [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Versus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo legitur biblia in refectorio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Post circumcisum Petrum, tunc perlege Paulum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \u8230 \'85 2. [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dum pulsantur campana ad matutinos (!), cogita te audire nuncium domini dicente tibi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dic ergo: O dulcissime Ihesu, qui pro me ligari dignatus es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;\red224\green224\blue224;}

