\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Distinctiones theologicae secundum ordinem alphabeti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Die Abschnitte zu den Buchstaben A und B fehlen. (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Setzt ein im Buchstaben \u8222 \'84C\ldblquote (zum Stichwort Caritas?): \u8230 \'85 \u9553 \'a6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si quis autem carnem suam cruciet, non ideo carnem suam odio habet, sed eius lasciviam et superbiam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zitat aus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Pictaviensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sententiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. PL 211, Sp. 1096C. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item in dilectione dei tres sunt gradus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Conceptio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 humana sic dicitur procedere et perfici. Primis vi diebus quasi lactis habeat similitudinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Exzerpt aus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De diversis quaestionibus octoginta tribus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Quaestio 56. Ed.: CC 44A, S. 95f. Z. 4\endash 23. CPL 289. Vgl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus X/1, S. 441 Nr 74. (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primi quasi incisivi sunt apostoli et primitivi sancti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Molares quasi extremi sunt patres moderni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 F\u252 \'fcr diese Passage vgl. den Druck: J.B. Pitra, Spicilegium Solesmense [\u8230 \'85], Bd 2, Paris 1855, S. 212, Sp. 1 Z. 39 \endash  Sp. 2 Z. 17 (Petrus Cantor et Garnerius Lingonensis). (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 triplex est constitutio: fundationis, executionis (sup. l.: erectionis) et consummationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota, quid sit seminandum, ubi, quando, quantum?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \u9553 \'a6 \u8230 \'85 Bricht ab.}

