\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De caelo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A summo celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ps 18,7). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In serie sacre scripture quam plures celos legimus. Est enim celum aerium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 celum mathematicum, celum celi et celum celorum. Celum dicitur quia celat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A summo celo egressio eius. A paterne maiestatis solio egreditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Mit kurzem, leicht ver\u228 \'e4nderten Exzerpt aus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Comestor}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Historia scholastica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Liber Genesis. PL 198, Sp. 1058 Z. 19\endash 38. (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Eintrag von P[eter] L[e Neve], Norroy, s.o.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de celo Aristotelis ut opinor.}

