\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In adventu Christi. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecce dominus veniet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Is 35,4\endash 6). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In his verbis loquitur propheta de adventu salvatoris, de incarnatione salvatoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 His diebus floribus id est virtutibus decorari debemus card\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 is id est austeritatibus ab omnibus illicitis peccatis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In nativitate Christi. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Puer, inquit, natus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Is 9,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vere nobis datus est, qui nobis natus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Suscipiamus hodie regem venientem, preparemus habitacula pectorum contra talem imperatorem, ut nos dignetur recipere in celesti Ierusalem. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non habemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Hbr 13,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum multa cotidie in humane fragilitatis condicione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schneyer 8}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 426 Nr 2. (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deum time\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ecl 12,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Duo itaque vectigalia sunt que deus a nobis requirit, scilicet amorem et timorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sunt omnia sex in deo pensanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut in presenti more sanctitate deo mereamur uniri et in futuro per ipsum et cum ipso gloriari. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nur zu Beginn \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sententiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], Series tertia, Nr 82. Vgl. Opera. Rec. J. Leclercq, H. Rochais, Bd 6/2, Rom 1972, S. 118. (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Veni, sancte spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notate verba, signate misteria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 oremus, ut saltem ? impetremus prestante hic nobis domino Ihesu Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Comestor}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo 19}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], in annuntiatione BMV. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Egredimini filie Syon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ct 3,11). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gloriosa dicta sunt sepe de gloriosa matre dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a qualibet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [liberet] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nos Ihesus Christus dominus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Druck: PL 198, Sp. 1772D\endash 1775D (in der Hs erweitert). Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schneyer 4}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 639 Nr 44. Angeh\u228 \'e4ngt: (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aliter de tribus diadematibus. Unum et primum quo coronat eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [i.e. Christum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iudea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85}

