\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (*2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash *7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Register von der Hand des Johannes Institoris. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit registrum sequencium 160 obieccionum in biblia repertarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b. Alphabetisch geordnetes Verzeichnis der behandelten Fragestellungen. Mit Erl\u228 \'e4uterung zur Benutzung des Verweisungssystems. \endash  (*8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash *12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannes Institoris}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Praelocutio [ad opera sequentia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prelocucio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad cavendum verba ociosa, de quibus oportet homines in extremo iudicio reddere racionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , debemus nos frequenter occupare per sacre scripture exposicionem, specialiter illis in locis, ubi quedam sibi videntur vocetenus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dissona et contraria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed reverendus in Christo pater dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gwilhelmus Rinaldi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tunc temporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prior Carthusie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 misit centum et sexaginta dubia domino Petro doctori sacre theologie Parisiensis studii petens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 solucionem eorundem dubiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed ne tociens fiat revolucio foliorum ego frater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Johannes Institoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 intendo primo scribere dubium et statim postea eiusdem responsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85}

