\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Magnificat anima mea dominum. Sancta Maria, mater domini nostri Ihesu Christi, per unicum filium tuum veni in adiutorium mihi cum omnibus sanctis tuis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 preces pro peccatis et angustiis et necessitatibus meis effundere digneris. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Stark erweitert gegen\u252 \'fcber Barr\u233 \'e9, Pri\u232 \'e8res, S. 115f. Nr 10.}

