\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\endash va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von einer Hand: 1. [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De planetis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Von der erden vnz an den manen sint xv tvsent milen vnd vi hvndert vnd xxv milen. Von dem manen vnz an mercurium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Disiv rechenvnge ist nach eins maister lere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aristotiles sprichet daz der erden vmbe ring ist xxiiii tvsent mile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Saturnus ist vber daz milze\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 der svnne vber das herze\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 div maniu vber daz hirtun.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 2. (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Isidorus [Hispalensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Etymologiarum sive originum libri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Exzerpt. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Isidorus in libro ethimolarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tractat de monstris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dicio [i.e. Tityon] novem iugeribus iacuit, Pigmei statura cubitales}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 PL 82, Sp. 420B\endash 422C. (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\endash vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De avibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ibis avis egypciaca dicit Papias}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod numquam proicit se ad volandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Herodio avis rapacissima, dicitur quod aquilam vincit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et vulgo dicitur girvalche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85}

