\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Feria 4}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 a}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Die meisten Texte auch Hs {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Weimar Oct 62}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , teils zu anderen Horen. (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Confessio ad virginem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  50, Nr 306 (1.2a.3\endash 20 u. zus\u228 \'e4tzl. Str. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Te opitulante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Auch Hs {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hildesheim J 30}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad primam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In manus tuas, sancta Maria, regina angelorum, mater misericordie, mater domini nostri Ihesu Christi, commendo animam meam et corpus meum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad terciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  32, Nr 58 (Str. 1a\endash 4a.5a.\endash 7b). (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad sextam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Mater misericordie, mater dei et hominis, mater tocius consolacionis, dignare suscipere hanc oracionem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad nonam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Frauwe magit liblich, Maria allir (121v) gnadin rych, dez paradizes suzekeyd}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 du rose royt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8230 \'85., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 der sundir troyst\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ich byt dich, o reyne magit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8230 \'85 Entspricht weitgehend dem Schlu\u223 \'dfgebet aus \u8222 \'84Unser vrouwen klage\ldblquote  (v. 1588\endash 1625 der Ed. von Gustav Milchsack, in: PBB 5, 1878, S. 277\endash 279), Schlu\u223 \'df abweichend; vgl. Hans-Joachim Ziegeler, in: VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  10, 1999, Sp. 90\endash 96 (mit Lit. zu \u220 \'dcberlieferung). (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad vesperas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. AH 32, Nr 23. (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad completorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. AH 32, Nr 182. Schlie\u223 \'dft: (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnipotens sempiterne deus, qui gloriose virginis et matris Marie corpus et animam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 preparasti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Erweitert gegen\u252 \'fcber dem Druck: Hortulus animae 1498, 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; vgl. auch Hs Hildesheim J 30, 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

