\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Versus de passione] Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De armis Christi Ihesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Culter, qui circumcidisti sacrosanctam carnem Christi, reseca nocentia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Druck: Hortulus animae 1498, 57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (in der Hs ein wenig verk\u252 \'fcrzt). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3541a.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Einleitungsgebet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quando volueris de passione domini meditari vel orare, procidas in faciem humiliter sic dicens: Domine Ihesu, o Christe bone pulcherrime, dulcis et misericors, ego sum ille peccator}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer. (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) bis auf 3 Nachtragszeilen (zu 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  unten) leer.
