\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 286\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rituale}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 -Auszug\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sterbe- und Begr\u228 \'e4bnisritus; vgl. Joseph-Marie Canivez, Le rite cistercien, in: Ephemerides liturgicae 63, 1949, S. 276\endash 311, hier 302f. Weitgehende \u220 \'dcbereinstimmung mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hs Hannover, LB, Ms I 96}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 269\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . ( 273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtrag am unteren Rand: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Psalmi ad unxionem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Ps 40. 42. 141. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Post\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [unctionem]\u8249 \'8b. Ps 102 (jeweils nur Anf\u228 \'e4nge). (273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Litania omnium sanctorum pro infirma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], zisterziensisch. Bemerkenswert bei den M\u228 \'e4rtyrern: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Stephane, Clemens, Laurenti, Maurici cum soc., Vincenti, Sebastiane, Hyrene cum soc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; bei den Bekennern: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicte, Bernarde, Roberte, Francisse, Egidi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Orationes]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 CO}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr 1620. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Respice, quesumus, domine, super famulam tuam infirmitate corporis sui laborantem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; CO Nr 6082. (277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Symbolum Apostolorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Credo. (278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Egressa anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iii Pater noster.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Versus]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Per invictam clemenciam remitte iam sentenciam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 [Responsorium], mit Noten. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Subvenite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 CAO}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr 7716. (279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tibi, domine, commendamus animam famule tue}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad sepulturam psalmi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Ps 113. 117. 41. 131. 138. 140. 141 (nur Anf\u228 \'e4nge). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Requiem eternam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CAO Nr 1783. (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Credo quod etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Antiphon], mit Noten. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clementissime domine, qui pro nostra miseria}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Post sepulturam lege vii psalmi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [paeniteniales]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In fine versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Requiem. Et ne nos. Non intres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oremus. Satisfaciat tibi, quesumus, domine deus noster, pro anima sororis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Teilweise ausradiert. (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ihesu Christe, qui passurus advenisti propter nos, domine miserere}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 5teilig, jeweils mit Pater noster. (282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio pro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [defuncta ad BMV]\u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paradysi porta, per quam lux est orta, natum tuum ora pro anima}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Anfang wie: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  39, Nr 8, Str. 15. (283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. CO Nr 191 (BMV-Variante). Es folgen F\u252 \'fcrbitten f\u252 \'fcr Verstorbene zum Psalmengebet, Initien im Register.}

