\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de paenitentia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Nachgetragener Titel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de penitentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; vgl. auch die Rubrik auf fol. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 uoniam }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (?)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  de penitentia tractare proponimus, primo videndum est quid sit penitenia et unde dicatur et a quo inceperit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Decretum etiam est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [in] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eodem concilio,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ut] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gladium in ecclesiam nemo portet excepto tantum regali.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Dasselbe Initium in Hs {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Emden, Bibl. der Gro\u223 \'dfen Kirche, Hs. 4}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  18}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat. Niedersachsen Kurz 3, S. 74. Der Text ist {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 vor 1215}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  anzusetzen, vgl. (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  bzw. 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Laien sollen dreimal im Jahr (vor Ostern, vor Weihnachten, vor dem Natale Johannis Bapt.), Kleriker jeden Samstag beichten. Als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 necessaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  f\u252 \'fcr die Bu\u223 \'dfe werden angesehen: (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cordis contricio, oris confessio, operum satisfactio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Weitere Themen: (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Laienbeichte, (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 legis diversiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de vii capitalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [vitiis], (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Simonie, (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sex operum misercordie negligentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sacrilegium triplex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) S\u252 \'fcnden wider Gott Vater, Sohn und Heiligen Geist, (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpt aus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Burchardus Wormaciensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Corrector sive Medicus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], PL 140, Sp. 949A\endash 951C. (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De diversitate delictorum et remediis ipsorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Zitiert werden: die Bibel, Augustinus, Gregorius, Hieronymus, Isidorus, Beda. Unmittelbar angef\u252 \'fcgt:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paenitentiale}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Bu\u223 \'dfbestimmungen zu folgenden Vergehen: (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) homicidium, (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) fornicatio, adulteria, (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) periurium, (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) falsum testimonium, (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) furtum, usura, (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) excommunicatio, (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) incantationes, (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) apostasia, (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) crapula, ebrietas etc. (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Bestimmungen f\u252 \'fcr verschiedene Bu\u223 \'dfleistungen.}

