63 (zu 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[6].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Bischoff, Katalog 1}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 102 Nr 483 (zu Faszikel III).}

