\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Passio sanctorum Caeciliae, Valeriani, Tiburtii et Maximi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], recensio longior. Anfang fehlt wegen Blattverlusts. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Setzt ein im Prolog: \u8230 \'85 [poenas] \u9553 \'a6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 incendii, quas patitur indicat. Atque se flammarum atrocitate aduri commemorans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit prologus. Lectio prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnibus patent Christi vestigia ideoque omnibus clamat: Venite ad me}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Handwechsel:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Turgius Almachius urbis praefectus sanctos dei fortiter laniabat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in qua benefitia domini exuberant ad memoriam beatae Caeciliae usque in hodiernum diem ipso praestante qui vivit et regnat in saecula saeculorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Bis 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Einteilung in 8 Lektionen. Ed.: Hippolyte Delehaye, \u201 \'c9tude sur le l\u233 \'e9gendier romain. Les saints de novembre et de d\u233 \'e9cembre (Subsidia hagiographica 23), Br\u252 \'fcssel 1936, S. 195 Z. 6 \endash  S. 220. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr 1495 u. Nov. Suppl.; f\u252 \'fcr 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vgl. BHL Nr 8483.}

