\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collectio sermonum fratrum minorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 de tempore}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  et {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 de sanctis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Setzt mitten im Text ein: \u8230 \'85 \u9553 \'a6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Invitat ad studium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Videmus nunc \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (I Cor 13,12)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Si secundum propositum verbum exponerem senem laudem existens apostolus multum eam commendat dicens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica in quinquagesima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecce ascendimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 18,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Totale hodiernum evangelium in tria dividitur secundum triplicem eius partem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schneyer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  7, S. 352 Nr 46. (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo in capite ieiunii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In consecratione ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hodie salus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 19,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dedi te in lucem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Is 49,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In verbis secundo propositis tria de domino nostro notantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Folgt unmittelbar: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In cena domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt sermones festivi. In sancto Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Andreas \endash  Commemoratio omnium fidelium defunctorum, einschlie\u223 \'dflich Weihnachten, der Feste der Weihnachtsoktav und Circumcisio. (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In synodo clericorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt collationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De anima peccatrice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In festo sancte trinitatis sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In letaniis maioribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kirchweih-Predigten. (209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) wie 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sol illuminans per omnia respexit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 42, 16), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quoniam sine irradiacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lucis eterne tenebrescitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnis intelligencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Bricht am Lagenende ab.
