\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Bemerkenswert: (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Feria quinta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fili recordare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 16,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Felix, quem faciunt aliena pericula cautum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In verbo proposito triplex nobis demonstratur remedium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 F\u252 \'fcr den Vers vgl. [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Salimbene Parmensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (OFM; \u8224 \'861287/88): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Chronica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Ed.: CCCM 125, S. 605 Z. 13 und \u246 \'f6fter.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Predigten zu Franciscus-Festen: (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In translatione beati Francisci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Filii Iacob portantes Iacob patrem suum in terra Canaan sepelierunt eum in spelunca duplici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Gn 50,12f.). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Camelli regine Sabe portabant aromata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. II Par 9,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Per camelos regine Sabe intelligo sanctos predicatores sancte ecclesie, qui portant tria scilicet aromata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Die \u8222 \'84duplex spelunca\ldblquote  wird auf Unter- und Oberkirche von San Francesco in Assisi bezogen. (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In sancto Francisco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Congregamini filii Iacob et audite patrem vestrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Gn 49,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et: Audi Israel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Bar 3,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad reverentiam patris nostri Francisci nobis in verbis secundo propositis ostenditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ignem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ardentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Sap 18,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et: Viam sapientie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Prv 4,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Verbum secundo propositum est sapientissimi Salomonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In sancto Francisco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ipse directus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Sir 49,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sub figura Iosie regis, qui gubernavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad dominum cor suum, et interpretatur in quo est sanctificatio. Pater et rector beatus Franciscus convenienter describitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quartus angelus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Apc 8,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Labia sacer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dotis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mal 2,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tria enim sunt necessaria cuilibet predicatori volenti proponere verbum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Species quarti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Dn 3,92). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Revelasti ea parvulis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 11,25f.). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnis sanctifice illuminationis suscipiens et subiectum recipiens et principium manationis influens notatur in verbis secundo propositis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85}

