\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collectio sermonum fratrum praedicatorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Neben einigen nicht nachweisbaren St\u252 \'fccken zahlreiche Predigten des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aldobrandinus de Cavalcantibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  sowie einzelne Sermones des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aldobrandinus de Tuscanella}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, Scriptores OP}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr 134) und aus OP-Sammlungen. (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones quadragesimales}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (1.) [Q]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ue flens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Dn 13,35). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec verba dicuntur de Susana, cuius exemplo monemur ad fletum compun\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [c]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer). (264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones paschales. (276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (60.) [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 stote factores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Iac 1,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quia perfectio spiritualis vite consistit in preceptorum observatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Bricht ab.
