\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones selecti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Dominica prima adventus \endash  Epiphania domini. (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (1.) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecce venio \u8230 \'85}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (Apc 22,12)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Sicut dicit angelus. Anima creata est a magno magna, a recto recta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (2.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De dominica prima adventus domini etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicite filie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 21,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Antiqui fideles fuerunt diu in expectat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 one salvatoris eis promissi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cant. 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum esset rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dedit odorem suum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schneyer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2, S. 533 Nr 4 (Guilelmus Peraldus). (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (3.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedictus, qui venit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 21,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vias tuas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ps 24,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 David volens cantare coram domino ait: Vias tuas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (4.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De nativitate domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Natus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 2,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecce evvangelizo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 2,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplo angeli admonentur prelati ecclesiarum evvangelizare subditis suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (5.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fluvius egrediebatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Gn 2,10). (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Verba ista leguntur Gen. iii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et possunt sicut mihi videtur exprimi de hodierna sollempnitate, id est de nativitate domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (6.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inveni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [e]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tis infantem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 2,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed quem? Karissimi, admirabilem unde Ysa. ix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (10): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et vocabitur nomen eius admirabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (7.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De apparitione domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Surge illuminare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Is 60,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic possunt tria notari. Primum est civitas illuminata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (8.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item de eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Apertis thesauris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 2,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In hoc verbo quattuor notantur: modus offerendi, ibi: apertis thesauris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schneyer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3, S. 711 Nr 111 (Johannes de Rupella), Explicit abweichend.}

