\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus de Remis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de communi sanctorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit summa de communi sanctorum, primo de apostolis sermo primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (1.) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui sunt \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Is 60,8)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Profectus apostolorum volatui nubium et columbarum merito comparatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hii vix aut numquam reverti debent. Nota de corvo emisso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (2.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item de apostolis sermo secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nimis honorati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ps 138,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amici dei apostoli sunt propter tria, que pertinent ad omnes amicos. Primo propter voluntatum conformitatem et cordium unitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quando eis cum Christo potestas iuridiciaria deferetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (40.) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item de virginibus sermo quintus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quam pulchra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ct 7,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Christus in quattuor commendat sponsam suam, que in qualibet sponsa commendabilia sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit summa de communi apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Bestand nach {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schneyer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4, S. 752\endash 755 Nr 462. 464\endash 481. 482 + 483. 484. 485 + 486. 487 + 488. 489. 490. 492\endash 504. 506. Au\u223 \'dferdem nachweisbar: Hs {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Basel, UB, B VIII 3}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (u.a.), Initium-Nr 5151 (zu 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); Incipit und Explicit teilweise abweichend. Text\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, Scriptores OP}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr 3326 (mit Kenntnis dieser Hs). Vgl. auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Theol. lat. oct. 77}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat. Berlin 3.1, S. 88,\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 mit einer k\u252 \'fcrzeren Sammlung dieser Predigtreihe. \endash  50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

