\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hugo de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De institutione novitiorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], kurze Exzerpte aus cap. 10\endash 21. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De honesta conversatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quatuor debent esse in conversatione honesta. Disciplina in habitu, in gestu}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in loqutione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in commestione. In habitu v modis: in genere, qualitate, colore, conformatione et coaptatione vestimentorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non nudis articulis vice coclearis piscando, sed temperate sedendo, tractim, non nimia festinatione cibum et potum sumendo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. Druck: PL 176, Sp. 935, 3. Z. v.u. \endash  952, 13. Z. v.o. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung: Rudolf Goy, Die \u220 \'dcberlieferung der Werke Hugos von St. Viktor (Monographien zur Geschichte des Mittelalters 14), Stuttgart 1976, S. 340\endash 367. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr 4685 (u. Suppl.). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hamesse, Repertorium initiorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr. 27304. Eine Predigt mit identischem Initium in Hs {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Basel, UB, B X 29}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat. Basel 2, S. 707.}

