\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De memoria beneficiorum dei}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De memoria benefitiorum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Recordemur ergo misericordiarum dei, ut sic accendamur in amorem eius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Mit Initiale angeschlossen: (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Premium est videre deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et incessanter in contemplatione celestium requiescere.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Zusammengestellt aus: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De interiori domo seu de conscientia aedificanda}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], cap. 3, und [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Meditationes de cognitione humanae conditionis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ], cap. 4, Exzerpt. Druck: PL 184, Sp. 511f. bzw. Sp. 492\endash 494, 8. Z. v.o.}

