\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collectio exemplorum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Titel im Inhaltsverzeichnis (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item miracula de beata Maria virgine ac quedam alia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Unsystematische Sammlung von Exempeln aus verschiedenen Quellen; durch Blattverlust unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, s.o. Nachweis aus Poncelet, Miraculorum Index bzw. Tubach, Index exemplorum.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De passione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quidam homo sensit frequenter afflictionem spiritus, omni quinta feria statim post horam nonam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De passione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quodam tempore in cena domini, cum idem homo esset communicaturus, videt in spiritu dominum Ihesum stantem ante altare}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De beata virgine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Die quadam, cum idem homo legerit in canone illam orationem \u8218 \'82Maria, mater gratie\lquote , vidit in spiritu angelos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Monachus Cisterciensis apparens cuidam post mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\u9553 \'a6 \u8230 \'85 Bricht nach 2 Zeilen ab. (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlu\u223 \'df aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Poncelet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr 819 (= {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tubach}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr 3720), vgl. Druck: Liber de miraculis sanctae dei genetricis Mariae. Published at Vienna in 1731 by Bernard Pez; reprinted for the first time by Thomas Frederick Crane, Ithaca [u.a.] 1925, S. 9f. (in der Hs leicht gek\u252 \'fcrzt). (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item de eruptione monachi per beatam virginem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Poncelet Nr 469. (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod malum sit spetialia querere ad edendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Poncelet Nr 451. (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo de infamia beata virgo quosdam liberavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Poncelet Nr 238. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo Leoni propria manus redditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Poncelet Nr 956 = Tubach Nr 2419. (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De malo preposito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In vitas patrum dicitur, quod cum quidam malus prepositus esset, qui deum non timebat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Tubach Nr 4002 (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124, Fontes exemplorum S. 438 Nr 145). (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De milite qui fuit raptor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dicitur quod quidam miles fuit raptor et flagitiosus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 Tubach Nr 3477a bzw. 3694 (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124, Fontes exemplorum S. 465f. Nr 195). (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De barbitonsore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dicitur quod cum barbitonsor singulis annis festum feceret beati Nicholai}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Tubach Nr 480, 1018 bzw. 3474 (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124, Fontes exemplorum S. 473f. Nr 222). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quidam scolaris, cum adamasset quandam mulierem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Tubach Nr 2440 bzw. 4196 (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124, Fontes exemplorum S. 473 Nr 221). (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De abbate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In dialogo dicitur quod quidam abbas moriens, cum interrogaretur a monachis suis, quem eis subsisteret abbatem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Tubach Nr 4526 (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124, Fontes exemplorum S. 439f. Nr 147). \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De tonitruo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Accidit ut audivimus in diocesi Remensi, quod tres pueri iacebant in uno loco}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124, Fontes exemplorum S. 502f. Nr 286. (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Audivimus, quod quidam dux, cum esset in extremis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Tubach Nr 1821, 4301 bzw. 5226 (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124, Fontes exemplorum S. 508f. Nr 306). \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Aristotile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Tubach Nr 331 (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124, Fontes exemplorum S. 517 Nr 338). \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum de scolari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Tubach Nr 1202a (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124B, Fontes exemplorum S. 451\endash 453 Nr 962\endash 965, S. 465 Nr 1004). \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item de clerico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quidam clericus Clarevallis tempore beati Bernardi se volens religioni dare quesivit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Variante zu Tubach Nr 4890. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De comite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item audivi quod cum quedam ecclesia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (70}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 consecraretur, in qua erat quidam comes sepultus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Tubach Nr 4880 (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124, Fontes exemplorum S. 519\endash 521 Nr 346). (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De milite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Erat quidam nobilis miles habens uxorem, qui vovit deo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Poncelet Nr 1436. (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De latrone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Tubach Nr 4783. (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De homine mala cogitante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Tubach Nr 1564 bzw. 3572 (Stephanus de Borbone: CCCM 124B, Fontes exemplorum S. 468 Nr 1010; Caesarius Heisterbacensis: Lib. VIII miraculorum I,29). (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De muliere superba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Tubach Nr 4275 (Caesarius Heisterbacensis: Lib. VIII miraculorum I,32). (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De viatore et tabernatore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Tubach Nr 4882 (Caesarius Heisterbacensis: Lib. VIII miraculorum I,37). (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De milite luxurioso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Tubach Nr 2944f (Caesarius Heisterbacensis: Lib.VIII miraculorum I,44). (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De milite superbo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Tubach Nr 2944f/1 (Caesarius Heisterbacensis: Lib. VIII miraculorum I,45). (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De mulierie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cui ymago beate Marie arrisit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Poncelet Nr 751 = Tubach Nr 439 (Caesarius Heisterbacensis: Lib. VIII miraculorum II,4). Vgl. jeweils Ed.: Alfons Hilka (Hrsg.), Die Wundergeschichten des Caesarius von Heisterbach, Bd 3 (Publikationen der Gesellschaft f\u252 \'fcr Rheinische Geschichtskunde 43), Bonn 1937.}

