\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Gustav H\u228 \'e4nel, Auszug aus dem Catalogue of the Manuscripts at Ashburnham Place 1853. London. Printed by Charles Francis Hodgson [gedruckt als Manuskript] (Fortsetzung), in: Intelligenz-Blatt zum Serapeum Nr 19, 15. Oktober 1862, S. 145\endash 150, hier 149 s.v. Lactantius. \endash  Aukt.Kat. The Ashburnham Library. Catalogue of the portion of the famous collection of manuscripts of [\u8230 \'85] the Earl of Ashburnham known as the \u8222 \'84Barrois Collection\ldblquote , Sotheby\rquote s London 10th\endash 14th June 1901, S. 214 Lot 583. \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  X/2, S. 113.}

