\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Albertus Magnus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paradisus animae] sive tractatus de veris virtutibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sunt quedam vicia, que frequenter speciem virtutum pretendunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Caritas ad deum vera est et perfecta est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in custodia oculorum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Epilog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Conqueror tibi, deus omnipotens, cum lacrimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia omnes unice sunt in gracia, quam nobis concedere dignetur etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus domini Alberti Magni de veris virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Ed.: Opera omnia. Ed. A. Borgnet, Bd 37, Paris 1898, S. 447\endash 512. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Glorieux, Ma\u238 \'eetres}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr 6 cq. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr 5875 u. 677 (u. Suppl. Nr 5875). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hamesse, Repertorium initiorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr 31858 (mit dieser Hs). S.a. Werner Fechtner, Zur handschriftlichen \u220 \'dcberlieferung des Ps.-Albertischen \u8218 \'82Paradisus animae\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und seiner \u220 \'dcbersetzungen ins Mittelhochdeutsche, in: ZfdA 105, 1976, S. 66\endash 87. Bertram S\u246 \'f6ller, in: VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  7, 1989, Sp. 293\endash 298.}

