\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones super Pater noster}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Paternoster-Lemmata und Anf\u228 \'e4nge der Quaestionen in gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferer Schrift. (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Queritur an oracio dominica sit excelsior omnibus oracionibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Respondet Damascenus libro 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  capitulo vicesimo 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Oracio est peticio decencium a deo. Unde oracio quinque debet in se habere. Primo ex parte eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pater. Queritur vtrum deus conveniencius dicitur pater quam dominus. Respondet Augustinus. Licet multa scripta sunt in veteri testamenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \u8230 \'85\endash  (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui eam proprio ore docuerat quod nobis concedat qui sine fine vivit et regnat deus per infinita secula seculorum. Amen.}

