\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dionysius Cartusianus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exhortatorium novitiorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. Innerhalb des Textes \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cristus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Novicius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  bzw. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  in gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferer Schrift, nur 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ristus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) am Rand\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nemo mittens manum suam ad aratum \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Lc 2,62)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Hoc in ewangelio generaliter sum locutus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad laudem et gloriam omnipotentis, qui est super omnia deus sublimis et benedictus. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Versus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Penna gradum siste quia liber explicit iste}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Colophons}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr 22837f.). Ed.: Dionysii Cartusiani opera omnia, Bd 38, Tournai 1909, S. 525\endash 545. Zur handschriftl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung: Kent Emery Jr., Dionysii Cartusiensis opera selecta 1A (CCCM 121), Turnhout 1991, S. 244 Nr 125 (ohne Kenntnis dieser Hs).}

