\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pater sancte ac amantissime, in unione divini amoris filij tui, dulcissimi domini nostri Ihesu Christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , commendo tibi hodie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 corpus et animam meam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
