\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quinque Pater noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dyt bet les na vyf Pater noster vnn wes du godde byddest dat der salychet tohort, dat wert dy twydet vor dyk vnn vor eynen andern vnn ok vor de selen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Here hemmelsche vader, dorch dynen ewygen eyngeboren sone vnn dorch dat kreftyge ghebet, dat he to dyk sprak}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nu bydde yk dyk myth den suluen worden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85}

