\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Protestatio morientis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Protestatio mortuorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Einleitung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 He protestationes morienci \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Auslassung?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  erunt, fuerunt revelate cuidam religioso per sanctum angelum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et nota quod infirmus an\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [te]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  protestationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 debet duos aut tres de devotis aut consangwineis et si litteratus sit legat, si non autem sibi legere faciat in modum qui sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In nomine patris et filij et spiritus sancti. Ego Margareta protestor coram vobis hic presentibus et coram sanctissimo angelo meo michi ex divina pietate ex utero matris deputato}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et coram sanctissimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 apostolis meis sanctis Bartolomeo, Iohanni et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod in ea vera fide quam sancta romana et apostolica profitetur ecclesia, in quam omnes decesserunt sancti, mori volo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic ultimo commendo tibi, angele sancte, extremam horam vite mee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Infirmus si potest sepe perlegat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut dum est in agonia teneat cedulam circumvolutum candele accense in dextera manu usque ad exitu anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b.}

